{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Copper walks back over, “Cato my friend! How are you?”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:45:20.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739569547639783424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Doing well. Hard at work\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:45:36.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739569614488338473","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“Wonderful. Speaking of work, I’ve got two things to ask of you. Firstly, Sandigil has brought it to my attention they we need to build a warehouse for our food and was wondering if you could lend us your aid.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:46:46.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739569907833765930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Maybe I can tomorrow. I devoted myself to Wynne and Wren today.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:47:37.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739570120166211747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“I understand, thank you my friend. Secondly, I’ve heard that you have decided to run for mayor as well, is that true?”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:48:30.517000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739570343810957482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I am. Skitter and Arc believe I can do good for this town. That is all I wish for. If they think I would be the best fit then I will do my best for them. I hope you do not feel discouraged by this.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:49:41.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739570642512248952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“That is interesting to hear, that is what was told to me as well. I was considering something before you put your name in, and I didn’t think it could work to well. But since there are 3 people running, I think it could work.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:54:29.769000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739571850622926968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“I was thinking instead of having one singular mayor, having a council. Keeping it small of course, but also keeping it an odd number so that decreases the likely hood of there being ties.”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:54:39.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739571890926125099","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“And since it would be the 3 of us, any decision would only need 2 out of 3’s approval for the decision to be made. Thus allowing the opposite sides argument to be heard, and allowing for better decisions to be made for the betterment of the town. What do you think my friend?”","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:54:46.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739571920269475910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I like the idea. Any one individual has flaws and bias. Having two others can keep them focused. I also think it would lead to better representation of the town. Putting people against eachother in the first week of a new settlement.\" He shakes his head. \"I agree with the plan Copper. I think a council would be a far more effective way to lead.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T19:57:17.099000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739572552455684173","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Copper bows his head “thank you my friend. I will bring this idea to Sandigil and see how he feels about it”","created_at":"2020-08-02T20:06:37.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739574900960002078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
